  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The World's A Ghetto** (1 review): Features guests Derek and Oteil; Derek plays a blazing solo while the band chugs along behind him; Oteil adds wild lines in the gaps between Derek's phrases [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The World's A Ghetto**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Uncle Jr [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive1999-09-10** (recommended): source not stated; 5 songs; 56 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer considers the opening tracks excellent examples of the band's early period [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive1999-09-10**: taped by unknown; transferred by Jeff Kennedy; source: (fob/dfc) Neumann KM184s > Lunatec V2 > DA-P1 [1]",
